## Bespoke payload — all customer fields (must appear in summary)

From `app/stickers/custom/page.tsx` submit payload:

| Key | Customer UI | Label in summary |
|-----|-------------|------------------|
| `roll.preset` / `variant` | Roll dropdown | Roll |
| `roll.notes` | Roll notes textarea | Roll notes |
| `roll.characterProductName` | Type F product name | Character product name |
| `text.line1` / `line2` | Sticker text | Sticker text |
| `text.notes` | Layout notes | Text layout notes |
| `font.presets.*` | Font picker | Font preset(s) |
| `font.name` | Custom font name | Custom font name |
| `font.source` | Font link | Font source / link |
| `font.notes` | Font notes | Font notes |
| `font.sizes.*` | Size pt inputs | Font size(s) |
| `logo.placementNotes` | Logo placement | Logo placement |
| `contact.name/email/phone` | Contact form | Contact name / email / Phone |
| `contact.extra` | “Anything else we should know” textarea | **Additional customer notes** |
