## Contact Us vs Bespoke Labels submit UX (learned 2026-09)

| | Contact (`app/contact/page.tsx`) | Bespoke (`app/stickers/custom/page.tsx`) |
|--|----------------------------------|------------------------------------------|
| Page title | Contact Us | **Bespoke Labels** |
| Success feel | Fixed **toast** top-right + fields cleared → feels like “refresh” | Must match: toast + clear + `formEpoch` remount |
| Clear timing | Immediately after `res.ok` (does **not** wait on Resend) | Same — clear after `{ success: true }` (notify already finished server-side for Bespoke) |
| Admin email | **`await notifyAdminsOfContactMessage`** after save | **`await notifyAdminsOfBespokeRequest`** after save |

**Root cause of “form still filled” reports:**

1. Testing **production** (`www.selpic.com.au`) — local UX not deployed yet.
2. Success banner at page top while form stayed visible (v2/v3) — fixed in **v4** with full-screen thank-you.
3. Native file input does not clear without remount — use `key={formEpoch}` after success.
4. Empty or 0-byte `logoFile` multipart confused old server validation — use `parseBespokeLogoFormEntry`.

**Invariant:** Save request → return success to browser → clear/remount form + thank-you screen + toast. Bespoke awaits admin Resend **before** JSON so company email is not dropped on serverless.

