## Do not

- Use `JSON.stringify(payload)` in operator-facing panels (debug `<details>` removed from Bespoke admin).
- Duplicate bespoke summary logic in `bespoke-requests/page.tsx` — import shared helper.
- Send bespoke admin notify without `requestSummary` bodyText.
- Remove or skip `notifyAdminsOf*` after successful customer intake without an explicit product decision.

---

## When adding a new storefront form field

1. Add to submit payload in storefront page.
2. Add line to `bespokePayloadDetailLines` (or channel equivalent).
3. Add test in `bespokeRequestSummary.test.ts`.
4. Verify Bespoke admin + Agent inbound + notify email.
